        "original_id": "cfa2c3c3-5b3b-546a-b902-a55b62b424f1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Guilin, Ankang, Huyi District, Xianyang, Chang'an District, Shaanxi Province, Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region, China\n- Organizations: Guangxi Normal University\n\nFacts:\n- Guilin, formerly romanized as Kweilin, is a prefecture-level city in northeastern Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region, China.\n- Ankang is a prefecture-level city in southern Shaanxi Province, China.\n- Guangxi Normal University is a university located in Guilin, Guangxi, China.\n- Huyi District borders Xianyang to the north, Ankang to the south, and Chang'an District to the east.",
